---
description: Writing or editing a feature spec in docs/specs
globs: docs/specs/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use docs/specs/_TEMPLATE.md. Number every rule and give each a worked
  example with real numbers.
- "Open questions" must be empty before Status becomes Approved.
- After approval, a rule change bumps Version and adds a Changelog line;
  never silently edit an approved rule.
